  "project_description": "Route Title Updater is a flexible developer-focused module for Drupal that allows administrators to dynamically alter, override, manage, and version route titles across the site — without modifying core, contrib, or theme code.\n\n This module is especially useful for SEO optimization, UX refinement, and enterprise-level title governance where default route titles are too limited.\n\n Installation \n \n After enabling the module: Click Configure. \n You will see a listing of all available routes from: \n 1. Custom modules\n\n 2. Contributed modules\n\n Select any route that contains a route title. \n Override the title based on your requirements \n While editing the title, built-in SEO validation runs automatically. \n \n No core hacks. No template overrides. No code changes required.",
